'''Coins''' serve as the currency for {{R|Shop}}s, the payment for the {{Machine|Donation Machine}} in Shops, and payment for {{Machine|Slot Machine}}s, {{Machine|Fortune Telling Machine}}s, {{Machine|Shell Game}}s, {{Machine|Beggar}}s, {{Machine|Shop Restock Machine}}s, and {{Machine|Crane Game}}s. They are also consumed to use a few [[activated item]]s (most notably {{i|Magic Fingers}} and {{i|Portable Slot}}). {{c|Keeper}} can also pick up coins to refill his [[health]].

